# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# SDR captures: ELRS Find sweeps (captures/elrs_find_*/) are SYNCED as part of the
# project (the user pushes/pulls them like any other file — no separate upload).
# So UN-IGNORE the captures/ dir's IQ + meta + manifest. Everything else that looks
# like a stray capture (a .complex8/.iq/.jsonl outside captures/) stays ignored.
#   (the `!` lines re-include the captures/ subtree after the blanket ignores above)
*.iq
*.complex8
*.jsonl
!captures/
!captures/**/
!captures/**/*.complex8
!captures/**/*.meta.txt
!captures/**/*.json

# C++ build artifacts (cpp/build.sh produces these)
cpp/elrs_intercept
cpp/tests/test_elrs_decode
cpp/tests/test_lora_demod
cpp/*.o

# Tarballs / archives — never commit
*.tgz
*.tar.gz

# Scan output (regenerated)
scan.jsonl
